# Design Tokens

## Colors

Never hardcode colors in components. Import from `@/lib/constants/colors` or use CSS variables from `globals.css` (`--color-brand-*`).

Approved palette:
- Background: `#0A0A0A`, `#111111`, `#1A1A1A`
- Gold: `#D4AF37`; gradient `#FFD700 → #D4AF37 → #B8860B`
- Text: `#FFFFFF`, `#E5E5E5`
- Accents: gold highlights only

Avoid bright colors, cartoon illustrations, and generic template aesthetics.

## Typography

Never hardcode font families, sizes, or weights. Use `TYPO` / feature constants from `@/lib/constants/typography`. Do not use arbitrary `text-[…]` or inline font styles.

## Styling

- No inline `style={{}}` — use `className` with Tailwind utilities.
- Dynamic visual values → add tokens to `globals.css` `@theme` / `:root`, reference via `var(--…)`.
- Premium patterns: glassmorphism, gold glow borders, subtle gradients, Framer Motion.
- Prefer CSS variables + `@theme` over arbitrary Tailwind value classes.
